17</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Winfield</surname><given-names>JB</given-names></name><name><surname>Brunner</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Koffler</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Serologic studies in patients with systemic lupus erythematosus and central nervous system dysfunction</article-title>. <source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>1978</year>;<volume>21</volume>:<fpage>289</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>94</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">306251</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R18"><label>18</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Janwityanuchit</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Verasertniyom</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Vanichapuntu</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Anti-Sm: its predictive value in systemic lupus erythematosus</article-title>. <source>Clin Rheumatol</source><year>1993</year>;<volume>12</volume>:<fpage>350</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>3</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8258234</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R19"><label>19</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><name><surname>Ooi</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Prevalence and clinical significance of antibodies to ribonucleoproteins in systemic lupus erythematosus in Malaysia</article-title>. <source>Br J Rheumatol</source><year>1996</year>;<volume>35</volume>:<fpage>129</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>32</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8612023</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="R20"><label>20</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-